<title>SWEDEN: Skanska sees 96 profit above 3.5 bln skr.</title>
<headline>Skanska sees 96 profit above 3.5 bln skr.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish construction company Skanska AB said it expected 1996 profit after financial items to exceed 3.5 billion Swedish crowns, compared with a 1995 profit of 2.57 billion.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
